# Gamo Admin (apps/admin) — Internal Staff Boundary Secrets Example (.dev.vars.example)
# Public product Clerk accounts NEVER grant access to apps/admin.
# Admin access requires Cloudflare Zero Trust Access RS256 JWT or PBKDF2 Admin Gateway password auth + staff/superadmin D1 role.
# Shared local settings (ENVIRONMENT, SESSION_SECRET, REQUIRE_ADMIN_AUTH) are inherited from root .dev.vars / .env.

# Cloudflare Zero Trust Access
CF_ACCESS_TEAM_NAME="your-cf-access-team"
CF_ACCESS_AUD="your-cf-access-application-aud-tag"

# Optional initial bootstrap password for local/first-time admin setup (stored as PBKDF2-SHA256 in D1)
ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD=""
